* Open-loop output-swing testbench: inn at VCM, inp swept VCM-Vsw..VCM+Vsw (DC).
* Output swing = output range over which the small-signal gain dVout/dVid stays within 6 dB of its peak.
* DUT: .subckt dut iref inp inn out.
$HEADER
.param VDD=$VDD Iref=$IREF
.global vdd
.options reltol=1e-4 gmin=1e-12 vntol=1e-7 abstol=1e-12
.temp 27

$DUT

VSUP vdd 0 dc {VDD}
.param VCM=$VCM
IREF vdd niref dc {Iref}
VCMS ninn 0 dc {VCM}
VID ninp ninn dc 0
XDUT niref ninp ninn nout dut

.control
set wr_singlescale
set wr_vecnames
option numdgt=9
dc VID -30m 30m 5u
wrdata swing.txt v(nout)
.endc
.end
